[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2725268013","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104124#issuecomment-2725268013","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104124","id":2725268013,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6icEot","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-14T17:05:17Z","updated_at":"2025-03-14T17:05:17Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91633 looks similar, adding `Memory::calloc_static`.  Just taking a quick look through, I like the idea of using `p_ensure_zero` to reuse most of the function if we can, not sure if there's other differences between the two.\r\n\r\nFor naming I'm leaning more toward `calloc_static`, but either sounds good to me.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2725268013/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2725307416","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104124#issuecomment-2725307416","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104124","id":2725307416,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6icOQY","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-14T17:20:01Z","updated_at":"2025-03-14T17:39:29Z","body":"> https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91633 looks similar\r\n\r\nThis is the same idea indeed!\r\n\r\nI think calling the function `calloc_static` is somewhat dangerous: `calloc` normally accepts 2 parameters. If you call `Memory::calloc_static(1, 512)`, you may expect it to generate 512 bytes if you know `calloc` (analogously to `calloc(1, 512)`). Instead, you get 1 byte with `p_pad_align=true`. This is because `Memory::calloc_static` accepts parameters `bytes` and `pad_align`, while `calloc` accepts `num` and `bytes`. It's a misunderstanding waiting to happen.\r\n\r\nI instead opted to call it `zeroed` because that's consistent with other functions with similar behavior in the Godot codebase. The name is also (I think) more obvious what it does, at least to people who have never heard of `calloc`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2725307416/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810680233","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104124#issuecomment-2810680233","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104124","id":2810680233,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nh5Op","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-16T20:22:18Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T14:28:38Z","body":"Would be fair to add a `memcalloc()` or `memalloc_zeroed()` here:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/3c0652699add1ca69ef18dc4408e044f485ab829/core/os/memory.h#L111-L115","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810680233/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810940638","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104124#issuecomment-2810940638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104124","id":2810940638,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ni4ze","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-16T22:17:33Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T17:54:02Z","body":"I found use for this in these files (all of them have occurrences of `memalloc`/`Memory::alloc_static` followed by resetting all values to 0):\r\n\r\n- core/io/zip_io.cpp\r\n- core/os/a_hash_map.h\r\n- core/templates/hash_map.h\r\n- core/templates/hash_set.h\r\n- core/templates/oa_hash_map.h\r\n- driver/gles3/shader_gles3.cpp","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810940638/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831978472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104124#issuecomment-2831978472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104124","id":2831978472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ozI_o","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T09:07:15Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T09:07:15Z","body":"Thanks a lot @DeeJayLSP!\r\nI've patched up all the spots you mentioned. Might as well make this a performance PR to motivate it better!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831978472/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831997098","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104124#issuecomment-2831997098","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104124","id":2831997098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ozNiq","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T09:41:33Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T09:42:01Z","body":"I benchmarked a ~4% improvement for (large) `HashMap` insertion:\r\n```c++\r\n\t// Setup\r\n\tHashMap<int, int> hash_map;\r\n\r\n\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < 20000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\t// Test\r\n\t\thash_map.insert(i, i);\r\n\t}\r\n\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis printed:\r\n- `2789ms` on `master`\r\n- `2681ms` on this PR","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831997098/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2874590621","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104124#issuecomment-2874590621","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104124","id":2874590621,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rVsWd","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-12T23:49:48Z","updated_at":"2025-05-12T23:59:10Z","body":"I rebased (to include https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106020 changes), and ran a slightly more complicated test (to cover more cases):\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n\tfor (int size : { 1, 2, 8, 64, 1024, 4096}) {\r\n\t\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\r\n\t\tfor (int run = 0; run < 20000000 / size; run++) {\r\n\t\t\tHashMap<int64_t, int64_t> dictionary;\r\n\t\t\tfor (int idx = 0; idx < size; idx ++) {\r\n\t\t\t\t// Test\r\n\t\t\t\tdictionary.insert(idx, idx);\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\r\n\t\tstd::cout << \"size:\" << size << std::endl;\r\n\t\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis printed on master (db6634352870de6a7e2f43dbac8cd74288b24743):\r\n```\r\nsize:1\r\n1464ms\r\nsize:2\r\n944ms\r\nsize:8\r\n579ms\r\nsize:64\r\n709ms\r\nsize:1024\r\n980ms\r\nsize:4096\r\n1328ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nOn this pr:\r\n```\r\nsize:1\r\n1268ms\r\nsize:2\r\n838ms\r\nsize:8\r\n550ms\r\nsize:64\r\n672ms\r\nsize:1024\r\n841ms\r\nsize:4096\r\n1149ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis new test suggests that, at least for fundamental types in key/value, `HashMap` insertion can be 15% faster (for normal sizes anyway). This makes the change more valuable than I previously assumed.\r\n\r\nAdmittedly, some of the speed difference may come from the new version using `memset`, but `calloc` should in some cases also skip the `memset`. This might be a bit harder to measure perfectly though, because whether it can skip it or not depends on how many blank pages of memory are available at the time of call.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2874590621/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888889059","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104124#issuecomment-2888889059","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104124","id":2888889059,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sMPLj","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-18T09:41:28Z","updated_at":"2025-05-18T10:15:46Z","body":"Out of interest, I just tested again using `alloc_static` with `memset` instead of `alloc_static_zeroed` on HashMap. I got this:\r\n\r\nmaster:\r\n```\r\nsize:1\r\n1430ms\r\nsize:2\r\n921ms\r\nsize:8\r\n563ms\r\nsize:64\r\n670ms\r\nsize:1024\r\n817ms\r\nsize:4096\r\n1134ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nmemset:\r\n```\r\nsize:1\r\n1283ms\r\nsize:2\r\n838ms\r\nsize:8\r\n545ms\r\nsize:64\r\n652ms\r\nsize:1024\r\n806ms\r\nsize:4096\r\n1088ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt's the same test, but quite different results from last time for `master`, so this definitely is a bit flaky.\r\nIn any case, it does seem like `memset` covers _most_ of the performance benefit, but not _all_ of it. I would therefore recommend to move forwards with this PR rather than detouring over `memset` first.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888889059/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2890958916","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104124#issuecomment-2890958916","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104124","id":2890958916,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sUIhE","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T13:05:06Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T13:05:06Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2890958916/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]